{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"In **ResStock 2025 Release 1**, the **Geometry Stories** characteristic reports:\n\n- **49%** of housing units are in **one-story buildings**.\n- **Data source:** U.S. EIA **2009 Residential Energy Consumption Survey (RECS) microdata**.\n- **Basements are excluded.** Stories count floors above grade; finished attics are included.\n\nSource: [ResStock 2025.1 Technical Reference, “Geometry Stories,” Table 11, p. 54](https://oedi-data-lake.s3.amazonaws.com/nrel-pds-building-stock/end-use-load-profiles-for-us-building-stock/2025/resstock_amy2018_release_1/ResStockTechnicalReferenceGuide_2025_1.pdf)."}}
